{"seq":1,"slug":"proxy-based-reactivity","title":"基于 Proxy 的响应式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/vue-in-depth/reactivity-system/proxy-based-reactivity","wordCount":869,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"基于-proxy-的响应式\">基于 Proxy 的响应式</h1><h2 id=\"响应式系统概述\">响应式系统概述</h2><p>Vue 3 的响应式系统是整个框架的基石。它能够自动追踪数据依赖并在数据变化时精确更新视图，这一切的核心都建立在 ES6 <strong>Proxy</strong> 之上。相比 Vue 2 基于 <code>Object.defineProperty</code> 的实现，Proxy 方案解决了诸多限制，提供了更完整的拦截能力。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph Vue2[&quot;Vue 2 - Object.defineProperty&quot;]&#10;        A2[对象属性] --&gt; B2[getter/setter]&#10;        B2 --&gt; C2[依赖收集 / 派发更新]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Vue3[&quot;Vue 3 - Proxy&quot;]&#10;        A3[整个对象] --&gt; B3[Proxy Handler]&#10;        B3 --&gt; C3[track / trigger]&#10;    end&#10;    Vue2 -.-&gt;|升级| Vue3\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph Vue2[\"Vue 2 - Object.defineProperty\"]\n        A2[对象属性] --&gt; B2[getter/setter]\n        B2 --&gt; C2[依赖收集 / 派发更新]\n    end\n    subgraph Vue3[\"Vue 3 - Proxy\"]\n        A3[整个对象] --&gt; B3[Proxy Handler]\n        B3 --&gt; C3[track / trigger]\n    end\n    Vue2 -.-&gt;|升级| Vue3</pre><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>理解 Proxy 响应式之前，先厘清贯穿本文的几个概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>响应式系统</strong>：数据变化时自动感知并通知依赖方更新的一组机制，它把「数据」与「视图」解耦。</li>\n<li><strong>Proxy</strong>：ES6 提供的对象代理层，可拦截 <code>get</code> / <code>set</code> 等基本操作，是 Vue 3 拦截能力的物理基础。</li>\n<li><strong>track（依赖收集）</strong>：属性被读取时记录「谁在读它」，把当前活跃的 effect 登记到该属性的依赖集合。</li>\n<li><strong>trigger（派发更新）</strong>：属性被写入时找出依赖它的所有 effect 并逐个执行。</li>\n<li><strong>依赖图</strong>：<code>WeakMap → Map → Set</code> 三层结构，把 target、key 与 effect 集合关联起来。</li>\n<li><strong>惰性代理</strong>：只在访问嵌套对象时才为其创建 Proxy，避免初始化时递归遍历整棵对象树。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"es6-proxy-基础\">ES6 Proxy 基础</h2><p><code>Proxy</code> 允许我们为对象创建一个代理层，拦截并自定义几乎所有基本操作。Vue 3 主要使用以下 trap：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Trap</th>\n<th>触发场景</th>\n<th>Vue 中的用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>get</code></td>\n<td>读取属性</td>\n<td>依赖收集（track）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>set</code></td>\n<td>设置属性</td>\n<td>派发更新（trigger）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>has</code></td>\n<td><code>in</code> 操作符</td>\n<td>模板中的属性检测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>deleteProperty</code></td>\n<td><code>delete</code> 操作</td>\n<td>删除属性时触发更新</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ownKeys</code></td>\n<td><code>Object.keys()</code></td>\n<td>遍历时收集依赖</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const handler: ProxyHandler&lt;Record&lt;string, unknown&gt;&gt; = {&#10;  get(target, key, receiver) {&#10;    track(target, key);&#10;    return Reflect.get(target, key, receiver);&#10;  },&#10;  set(target, key, value, receiver) {&#10;    const oldValue = target[key as string];&#10;    const result = Reflect.set(target, key, value, receiver);&#10;    if (oldValue !== value) {&#10;      trigger(target, key);&#10;    }&#10;    return result;&#10;  },&#10;};&#10;&#10;const observed = new Proxy(rawObject, handler);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> handler</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ProxyHandler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">target</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">receiver</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    track</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(target, key);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Reflect.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(target, key, receiver);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">target</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">receiver</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> oldValue</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> target[key </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Reflect.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(target, key, value, receiver);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (oldValue </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> value) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      trigger</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(target, key);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> observed</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Proxy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(rawObject, handler);</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> Vue 3 内部使用 <code>Reflect</code> 配合 Proxy，确保 <code>this</code> 指向始终正确，避免了直接操作 <code>target</code> 可能引发的问题。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"track-与-trigger-机制\">track 与 trigger 机制</h2><p>响应式系统的核心在于 <strong>track</strong>（依赖收集）和 <strong>trigger</strong>（派发更新）这两个函数。它们共同维护一个全局的依赖图。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph Track[&quot;track 阶段&quot;]&#10;        R[读取属性] --&gt; T1[获取当前活跃 effect]&#10;        T1 --&gt; T2[建立 target → key → effects 映射]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Trigger[&quot;trigger 阶段&quot;]&#10;        W[写入属性] --&gt; G1[查找 target → key 对应的 effects]&#10;        G1 --&gt; G2[依次执行所有 effect]&#10;    end&#10;    Track --&gt; |数据变化时| Trigger\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph Track[\"track 阶段\"]\n        R[读取属性] --&gt; T1[获取当前活跃 effect]\n        T1 --&gt; T2[建立 target → key → effects 映射]\n    end\n    subgraph Trigger[\"trigger 阶段\"]\n        W[写入属性] --&gt; G1[查找 target → key 对应的 effects]\n        G1 --&gt; G2[依次执行所有 effect]\n    end\n    Track --&gt; |数据变化时| Trigger</pre><p>依赖关系存储在一个三层嵌套的 <code>WeakMap</code> 结构中：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"type Dep = Set&lt;ReactiveEffect&gt;;&#10;type KeyToDepMap = Map&lt;string | symbol, Dep&gt;;&#10;&#10;const targetMap: WeakMap&lt;object, KeyToDepMap&gt; = new WeakMap();&#10;&#10;function track(target: object, key: string | symbol): void {&#10;  if (!activeEffect) return;&#10;  let depsMap = targetMap.get(target);&#10;  if (!depsMap) {&#10;    targetMap.set(target, (depsMap = new Map()));&#10;  }&#10;  let dep = depsMap.get(key);&#10;  if (!dep) {&#10;    depsMap.set(key, (dep = new Set()));&#10;  }&#10;  dep.add(activeEffect);&#10;}&#10;&#10;function trigger(target: object, key: string | symbol): void {&#10;  const depsMap = targetMap.get(target);&#10;  if (!depsMap) return;&#10;  const dep = depsMap.get(key);&#10;  if (dep) {&#10;    dep.forEach((effect) =&gt; effect.run());&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Dep</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ReactiveEffect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> KeyToDepMap</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> symbol</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Dep</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> targetMap</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> WeakMap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">object</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">KeyToDepMap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> WeakMap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> track</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">target</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> object</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> symbol</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">activeEffect) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> depsMap </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> targetMap.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(target);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">depsMap) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    targetMap.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(target, (depsMap </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dep </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> depsMap.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">dep) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    depsMap.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key, (dep </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  dep.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(activeEffect);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> trigger</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">target</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> object</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> symbol</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> depsMap</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> targetMap.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(target);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">depsMap) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> dep</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> depsMap.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (dep) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    dep.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">forEach</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">effect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> effect.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"依赖图结构\">依赖图结构</h2><p>依赖图使用 <code>WeakMap → Map → Set</code> 三层结构，保证了垃圾回收友好性和查找效率：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    WM[&quot;WeakMap (targetMap)&quot;]&#10;    WM --&gt; |target A| MA[&quot;Map (depsMap)&quot;]&#10;    WM --&gt; |target B| MB[&quot;Map (depsMap)&quot;]&#10;    MA --&gt; |&#39;count&#39;| SA[&quot;Set {effect1, effect2}&quot;]&#10;    MA --&gt; |&#39;name&#39;| SB[&quot;Set {effect1}&quot;]&#10;    MB --&gt; |&#39;value&#39;| SC[&quot;Set {effect3}&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    WM[\"WeakMap (targetMap)\"]\n    WM --&gt; |target A| MA[\"Map (depsMap)\"]\n    WM --&gt; |target B| MB[\"Map (depsMap)\"]\n    MA --&gt; |'count'| SA[\"Set {effect1, effect2}\"]\n    MA --&gt; |'name'| SB[\"Set {effect1}\"]\n    MB --&gt; |'value'| SC[\"Set {effect3}\"]</pre><p>当 <code>target</code> 对象被垃圾回收时，<code>WeakMap</code> 中对应的条目也会自动清除，不会造成内存泄漏。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"vue-2-vs-vue-3-响应式对比\">Vue 2 vs Vue 3 响应式对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比维度</th>\n<th>Vue 2（defineProperty）</th>\n<th>Vue 3（Proxy）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>拦截粒度</td>\n<td>单个属性</td>\n<td>整个对象</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数组支持</td>\n<td>需重写数组方法</td>\n<td>原生支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>新增属性</td>\n<td>需要 <code>Vue.set()</code></td>\n<td>自动检测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>删除属性</td>\n<td>需要 <code>Vue.delete()</code></td>\n<td>自动检测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能</td>\n<td>初始化时递归遍历所有属性</td>\n<td>惰性代理，访问时才递归</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Map/Set 支持</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>浏览器兼容</td>\n<td>IE9+</td>\n<td>不支持 IE</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// Vue 2 的局限：无法检测新增属性&#10;const vm = new Vue({&#10;  data: { user: { name: &#39;Alice&#39; } },&#10;});&#10;vm.user.age = 25; // ❌ 不是响应式的&#10;Vue.set(vm.user, &#39;age&#39;, 25); // ✅ 需要使用 Vue.set&#10;&#10;// Vue 3：Proxy 自动检测&#10;const state = reactive({ user: { name: &#39;Alice&#39; } });&#10;state.user.age = 25; // ✅ 自动成为响应式\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Vue 2 的局限：无法检测新增属性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> vm</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Vue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  data: { user: { name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Alice'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">vm.user.age </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 25</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ❌ 不是响应式的</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Vue.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(vm.user, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'age'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">25</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ✅ 需要使用 Vue.set</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Vue 3：Proxy 自动检测</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> reactive</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ user: { name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Alice'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">state.user.age </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 25</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ✅ 自动成为响应式</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"惰性代理与深层响应式\">惰性代理与深层响应式</h2><p>Vue 3 的 <code>reactive</code> 采用惰性代理策略——只有在访问嵌套对象时才会为其创建 Proxy，而不是在初始化时递归遍历整个对象树：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const state = reactive({&#10;  nested: {&#10;    deep: {&#10;      value: 42,&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;});&#10;&#10;// 访问 state.nested 时才为 nested 对象创建 Proxy&#10;// 访问 state.nested.deep 时才为 deep 对象创建 Proxy\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> reactive</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  nested: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    deep: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      value: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">42</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 访问 state.nested 时才为 nested 对象创建 Proxy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 访问 state.nested.deep 时才为 deep 对象创建 Proxy</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;reactive(obj)&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;创建顶层 Proxy&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;访问 obj.nested&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D{&quot;是否为对象?&quot;}&#10;    D -- 是 --&gt; E[&quot;为 nested 创建 Proxy 并缓存&quot;]&#10;    D -- 否 --&gt; F[&quot;直接返回原始值&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; G[&quot;返回嵌套 Proxy&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"reactive(obj)\"] --&gt; B[\"创建顶层 Proxy\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"访问 obj.nested\"]\n    C --&gt; D{\"是否为对象?\"}\n    D -- 是 --&gt; E[\"为 nested 创建 Proxy 并缓存\"]\n    D -- 否 --&gt; F[\"直接返回原始值\"]\n    E --&gt; G[\"返回嵌套 Proxy\"]</pre><p>这种策略在处理大型数据结构时显著提升了初始化性能。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Vue 3 使用 ES6 <strong>Proxy</strong> 替代 <code>Object.defineProperty</code>，获得了完整的对象操作拦截能力</li>\n<li><strong>track</strong> 在属性被读取时收集依赖，<strong>trigger</strong> 在属性被修改时派发更新</li>\n<li>依赖关系存储在 <code>WeakMap → Map → Set</code> 三层结构中，兼顾查找效率与垃圾回收</li>\n<li>相比 Vue 2，Proxy 方案原生支持属性新增/删除检测、数组索引操作和 Map/Set 类型</li>\n<li><strong>惰性代理</strong> 策略按需创建嵌套对象的 Proxy，避免了初始化时的性能开销</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"基于 Proxy 的响应式","id":"基于-proxy-的响应式"},{"level":2,"text":"响应式系统概述","id":"响应式系统概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"ES6 Proxy 基础","id":"es6-proxy-基础"},{"level":2,"text":"track 与 trigger 机制","id":"track-与-trigger-机制"},{"level":2,"text":"依赖图结构","id":"依赖图结构"},{"level":2,"text":"Vue 2 vs Vue 3 响应式对比","id":"vue-2-vs-vue-3-响应式对比"},{"level":2,"text":"惰性代理与深层响应式","id":"惰性代理与深层响应式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"ref 与 reactive","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/vue-in-depth/reactivity-system/ref-and-reactive"}}